# CRSP / Morningstar index data — kept on disk (Dropbox-synced), never pushed.
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. CRSP licenses the free constituent and index-level
# downloads for informational, non-commercial use only, with no redistribution;
# committing a 3,477-name constituent list with weights to a public remote is
# redistribution. The archive is the point of `cli.py crsp-snapshot`, so it must
# survive locally — it just must not be republished. Back it up outside git.
data/crsp/

# Codex review output — kept on disk as proof-of-run, but untracked.
# If tracked/untracked, each review appears in the next review's working-tree
# diff and pollutes it with hundreds of KB of prior review text (2026-07-20).
codex_feedback/

# Local runtime state for the #ipo reply poller (timestamps only).
data/ipo_reply_state.json

# Symbol-directory snapshots: the weekly archive (Nasdaq keeps none).
# Tracked deliberately - the diff is the product and it needs history.
!data/symbol_directory/

# One-off enrich log for the 2026-08-06 biopharma batch.
.health/enrich_*.log*
